 "summaries": [
  {
   "section": "Overall",
   "text": "This vehicle appears to be in working order as it was designed with wear and tear consistent with the age and mileage of the vehicle. All mechanical and electrical components were operating as designed at the time of inspection."
  },
  {
   "section": "Overall",
   "text": "There are misc scratches and chips around the vehicle. Normal for mileage and most too small to see in photos. The paint shows some wear and tear that is consistent with age and mileage. The underside shows areas of minor surface rust. The front and rear bumpers show signs of wear and tear consistent with the age and mileage of the vehicle. All four tires are dry rotted and at the end of their service life and should be replaced soon."
  },
  {
   "section": "Overall",
   "text": "There is wear to the seats. Normal for mileage. The inner door panels show wear consistent with age and mileage. The interior trim shows normal wear consistent with age and mileage. The carpet shows normal wear consistent with age and mileage. The floor mats show wear."
  },
  {
   "section": "Overall",
   "text": "I found no issues on the test drive. The engine had plenty of power and there were no misfires or smoking. The transmission worked as designed. The steering was responsive and the suspension was firm and the vehicle handled well. There were no abnormal vibrations or odd noises. The brakes were firm with no pulsation felt. There were no leaks found to the underside of the vehicle. I hooked up my Scan Tool to the computer system and found no current or pending codes. All of the live data looked good with no issues reported."
  }
